<section id="multiplayer" class="section">
  {# Hidden alias so cross-site links to #features still resolve. #}
  <span id="features" class="anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="mp-head reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow-mono">Multiplayer</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">AI stopped being single-player.</h2>
  </div>

  {# Two big phrases left, the live multiplayer chat right. The phrases ARE the
     copy for this section; everything deeper lives in the Q&A. #}
  <div class="mp-split reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="mp-phrases">
      <p class="mp-phrase">Everyone else's AI is locked in private chats.</p>
      <p class="mp-phrase is-strong">Houston puts your agents in front of the whole team.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mp-chat-col">
<div class="chat-demo reveal reveal-d1" data-chat-demo>
    <div class="chat-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Use cases">
      <button class="chat-tab active" data-uc="0" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Sales</button>
      <button class="chat-tab" data-uc="1" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Bookkeeping</button>
      <button class="chat-tab" data-uc="2" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Hiring</button>
      <button class="chat-tab" data-uc="3" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Support</button>
    </div>

    <div class="chat-win win">
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="chat-agent">
          <span class="av av-c" id="cd-agent-av" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="chat-agent-meta">
            <span class="chat-agent-name" id="cd-agent-name">Sales Rep</span>
            <span class="chat-mission" id="cd-mission">Rebuild the Q3 pipeline report</span>
          </span>
        </span>
        <span class="chat-people" id="cd-people" role="group" aria-label="People in this chat">
          <span class="face face-img" title="Julian"><img src="/assets/img/julian-48.webp" srcset="/assets/img/julian-96.webp 2x" width="48" height="48" alt=""></span>
          <span class="face face-img" title="Felipe"><img src="/assets/img/felipe-48.webp" srcset="/assets/img/felipe-96.webp 2x" width="48" height="48" alt=""></span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="chat-thread" id="cd-thread">
        <div class="cmsg cmsg-human">
          <span class="cmsg-av face-img"><img src="/assets/img/julian-48.webp" srcset="/assets/img/julian-96.webp 2x" width="48" height="48" alt=""></span>
          <div class="cmsg-main"><span class="cmsg-name">Julian</span><div class="cmsg-text">Rebuild the Q3 pipeline report. Pull every open deal from HubSpot, match it against the email threads in Gmail, and tell me what will really close.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmsg cmsg-agent">
          <span class="cmsg-av av av-c"></span>
          <div class="cmsg-main"><span class="cmsg-name">Sales Rep</span><div class="cmsg-text">Working through it. 63 open deals in HubSpot, cross-checked against Gmail. 12 have gone quiet for 3+ weeks, and 5 are stuck waiting on a contract from us.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmsg cmsg-human">
          <span class="cmsg-av face-img"><img src="/assets/img/felipe-48.webp" srcset="/assets/img/felipe-96.webp 2x" width="48" height="48" alt=""></span>
          <div class="cmsg-main"><span class="cmsg-name">Felipe</span><div class="cmsg-text">Exclude the churned accounts, and add the renewals coming up this quarter. <span class="mention">@Julian</span> the stalled ones are your call.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmsg cmsg-agent">
          <span class="cmsg-av av av-c"></span>
          <div class="cmsg-main"><span class="cmsg-name">Sales Rep</span><div class="cmsg-text">Updated. Dropped 4 churned accounts, added 9 renewals. Weighted pipeline is $1.4M, with $380K at real risk from the stalled threads.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmsg cmsg-human">
          <span class="cmsg-av face-img"><img src="/assets/img/julian-48.webp" srcset="/assets/img/julian-96.webp 2x" width="48" height="48" alt=""></span>
          <div class="cmsg-main"><span class="cmsg-name">Julian</span><div class="cmsg-text">Chase the stalled ones. Put it where the whole team can see it.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cmsg cmsg-agent">
          <span class="cmsg-av av av-c"></span>
          <div class="cmsg-main"><span class="cmsg-name">Sales Rep</span><div class="cmsg-text">Done. The report is on the shared board, at-risk deals flagged, a follow-up drafted for each. <span class="mention">@Julian</span> please confirm and I'll send all 12.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chat-composer">
        <span class="cc-avatar face-img"><img src="/assets/img/julian-48.webp" srcset="/assets/img/julian-96.webp 2x" width="48" height="48" alt=""></span>
        <span class="cc-placeholder">Message your team and the agent...</span>
        <span class="cc-send" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"/><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
